CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/workflows/
.workflow-kit/
.DS_Store
# dev/* rather than dev/: git cannot re-include a path inside an EXCLUDED
# directory, and task folders are the durable, version-controlled half of the
# task system (awesome-kit:task treats dev/tasks/<stub> as "version control IS
# the record"). A blanket dev/ ignore silently defeats that contract.
dev/*
!dev/tasks/
